 :question/worked-solution "We have $5\\in [a]_{8}$ if \n\n$$\n5≡a\\,(\\text{mod}\\,8).\n$$\n\nLet's now consider each of the given equivalence classes.\n\n- $5\\in [-3]_{8}$ because $5≡-3\\,(\\text{mod}\\,8)$ $\\,✓$\n\n- $5\\in [13]_{8}$ because $5≡13\\,(\\text{mod}\\,8)$ $\\,✓$\n\n- $5\\notin [6]_{8}$ because $5≢6\\,(\\text{mod}\\,8)$ $\\,\\times $\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only\"."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186412970 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186152098 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "9c1fe7ea-d91e-5440-b756-37a460a18f19" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Residue Classes Containing a Given Element"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "05f1d139-dd05-5eca-90be-15c2b7b3b5e3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412810} {:answer/id #uuid "289247b3-ccea-548c-98f4-0b63ed0ff7ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412823} {:answer/id #uuid "37e19197-89ec-5740-a612-329355a01a3c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I, II, and III" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412829} {:answer/id #uuid "8333d9d3-7f55-577e-83cc-7594a73289c1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412868} {:answer/id #uuid "a1b0ea22-0dae-5c5b-aa94-2a758d6e4fc0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412882}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8333d9d3-7f55-577e-83cc-7594a73289c1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412868} :answer-field/id #uuid "5decdc62-7308-5512-b750-a161dcc81e38" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412939}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "9c32efaa-b6d9-5d28-a23f-80c818eab9ef" :question/math-academy-id "q-86031" :question/problem "Which of the following residue classes modulo $7$ contain the integer $-2?$\n\nI. $[1]_{7}$\n\nII. $[5]_{7}$\n\nIII. $[-9]_{7}$" :question/worked-solution "We have $-2\\in [a]_{7}$ if \n\n$$\n-2≡a\\,(\\text{mod}\\,7).\n$$\n\nLet's now consider each of the given equivalence classes.\n\n- $-2\\notin [1]_{7}$ because $-2≢1\\,(\\text{mod}\\,7)$ $\\,\\times $\n\n- $-2\\in [5]_{7}$ because $-2≡5\\,(\\text{mod}\\,7)$ $\\,✓$\n\n- $-2\\in [-9]_{7}$ because $-2≡-9\\,(\\text{mod}\\,7)$ $\\,✓$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only\"."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186412971 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186152097 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "3d2f207a-8e99-5520-ab9f-266c8f54465b" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Elements Belonging to a Residue Class"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "14030e88-6395-56f9-82ae-0053228a0a90" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I and II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412817} {:answer/id #uuid "8ed69294-b796-5762-a670-e84ffa5fce8c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412874} {:answer/id #uuid "a892cb8e-e16a-5a18-b277-91ca8afd57cc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I, II, and III" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412885} {:answer/id #uuid "d22c7286-cdcb-5191-9d60-a9974ca672d6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II and III only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186412909} {:answer/id #uuid "d73fae85-da65-51ae-ad7a-ae836d3b1e11" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 